<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><em>Cut it off, you've already lost!</em><br />
<em>All that precious bravery is gonna get you hurt,</em><br />
<em>In a world that feeds on the minority.</em><br />
<em>May that self-centered belief lead you to peace!</em><br />
<em>If you're gonna replace me,</em><br />
<em>At least have the audacity to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nOj_A3aZxGs">kill me thoroughly</a>.</em></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>Heya! This is an experimental piece for me, so I'm hoping that I managed to get some things right. This was heavily inspired by <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/568220/Lobotomy_Corporation__Monster_Management_Simulation/">Lobotomy Corporation</a> and its sequel <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1256670/Library_Of_Ruina/">Library of Ruina</a>, specifically the term &quot;abnormality,&quot; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q_4jXySUgLM">this song</a> from Library of Ruina (as well as <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nOj_A3aZxGs">String Theocracy</a>, which I quoted above), and the symbolism used in both games. Give both of those a look!</p>
<p>Thank you to everyone who helped me write this, including:</p>
