<li><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5158506); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5158506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="Aethris" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5158506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5158506); return false;">Aethris</a></span></strong>, who heavily encouraged me to continue writing.</li>
<li><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;">JackalRelated</a></span></strong>, who gave some early-on critique and indirectly helped pushed me to write.</li>
<li><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/popsioak" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5231418); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5231418&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="Popsioak" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5231418)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/popsioak" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5231418); return false;">Popsioak</a></span></strong>, <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/justbixby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5272357); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5272357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="JustBixby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5272357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/justbixby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5272357); return false;">JustBixby</a></span></strong>, <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pr0m37h3um" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3628082); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3628082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="pr0m37h3um" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3628082)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pr0m37h3um" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3628082); return false;">pr0m37h3um</a></span></strong>, <strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3093017); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3093017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592593955" alt="Brewsterion 1017" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3093017)" />