<p>So to begin, I was so ecstatic to learn that Yossi had gotten my ConProcs! He's a wonderful author and I'm a big fan of him, so I knew this was gonna be great<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-687576-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-687576-1')">1</a></sup>.</p>
<p>Regarding the ConProcs themselves, I think they're my favorite I've ever written. I wanted to be sure I would write something that inspired something interesting within the other author, without forcing them into a box. I had a lot of fun with this idea, and I think the idea of a conceptual site was my favorite, and I'm glad Yossi used it so well.</p>
